flowchart TD
    A[Pick storage account name] --> B{Name available?}
    B -->|Taken| C[Append digit,<br/>update GH variable]
    C --> A
    B -->|Available| D[Create storage account]

    D --> E[Enable static website,<br/>set index/error docs]
    E --> F{Docs still saved<br/>after refresh?}
    F -->|No, fields empty| G[Re-enter and<br/>re-save document names]
    G --> F
    F -->|Yes| H[Assign RBAC role<br/>to service principal]

    H --> I[Push to main]
    I --> J[Runner: checkout,<br/>azure/login]
    J --> K{Role assignment<br/>propagated?}
    K -->|No, AuthorizationPermissionMismatch| L[Wait 1-2 min,<br/>re-run job]
    L --> J
    K -->|Yes| M[upload-batch into<br/>$web container]

    M --> N[Visitor requests /]
    N --> O{Root resolves?}
    O -->|WebContentNotFound| P{/index.html direct<br/>loads?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Fix static-website<br/>index-doc setting]
    Q --> N
    P -->|No| R[Files missing,<br/>check upload logs]
    O -->|Yes| S[Site serves live]

    style C fill:#fdf3e0,stroke:#c08a2b,color:#7d5a12
    style G fill:#fdf3e0,stroke:#c08a2b,color:#7d5a12
    style L fill:#fdf3e0,stroke:#c08a2b,color:#7d5a12
    style Q fill:#fdf3e0,stroke:#c08a2b,color:#7d5a12
    style R fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c0392b,color:#7b241c
    style S fill:#e8f8ec,stroke:#2ea043,color:#14532d
